Data notice

The depot-key and app-access-token data committed to this repository is
collected from public Steam endpoints and is provided as a community cache
for use with the SteamTools desktop client and the user-facing tool at
https://steamtools.games/. The data is offered without any warranty as to
fitness for any particular purpose. Use of this data is subject to
Steam/Valve's terms of service.
